# Trivy Ignore Policy

# PyJWT is pinned to <2.0.0 by fastapi-jwt-auth.
# Cryptographic signature verification and acceptable algorithms are strictly enforced
# by fastapi-jwt-auth, mitigating these issues.
CVE-2022-29217
CVE-2026-32597

# Starlette is a transitive dependency of fastapi. The fix ships in starlette 1.x,
# which requires fastapi>=0.128.3 and pydantic>=2.7, but this project is pinned to
# pydantic<2.0.0 (a pydantic v2 migration is out of scope). Neither vulnerable surface
# is used by the app: there are no StaticFiles mounts (CVE-2026-48818) and no
# request.form() calls (CVE-2026-54283).
CVE-2026-48818
CVE-2026-54283
